    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Multiply this across the $8&#8211;12 billion that poor address data costs the global payments industry annually, and the case for structured resolution becomes less about compliance and more about competitive economics.</p>

    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#444444;">
