    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 14px 0;">The trajectory is clear. Institutions treating hybrid as a destination — rather than a waypoint — are building compliance debt that compounds with every enforcement milestone.</p>

