    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 14px 0;">If you&#8217;re evaluating address resolution vendors — or if your institution is building an internal solution — there&#8217;s one question that separates tools built for payments from tools built for basic postal validation. Ask it in every vendor conversation:</p>

    <!-- Tip callout -->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background:#232F3E;padding:10px 20px;">
